      "content": "thanks. looks good. one thing though—can you add a section about the 'quality of service' differences? i want to make sure they know that while the new engine is faster, there might be some trade-offs in the level of detail or personalization they've gotten used to with you. just a heads up so they aren't surprised if the responses feel a bit more robotic or less nuanced.",
